00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:18.540
I've told you before that Republicans have
been causing a problem for themselves in Georgia

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.110
because on the one hand, they're insisting
and Trump has been insisting that the November

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.300
