00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.200
He won, but it was rigged.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.400
And so Joe Biden claims to have won the votes
can't be trusted.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.890
The Georgia Republican governor can't be trusted.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.730
The Georgia Republican secretary of state
is in on it.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:37.750
They're bad people.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.060
It's all rigged.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.650
And at the same time, Trump and the two Republican
Senate candidates in Georgia, Kelly Leffler

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.840
and David Perdue, these are the races that
will determine who controls the Senate after

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.270
