00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:54.160
They've been saying, yeah, it was rigged against
Trump and make sure to vote for us on January

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.170
5th.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.180
What?

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:00.650
Because the obvious question is we there's
a contradiction there.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:05.990
The election was rigged against Trump and
presumably also rigged against them in November.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:09.860
Maybe Loffler and Perdue would have won had
