00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.390
But because of the rigging, now they have
runoffs.

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:15.920
But wouldn't the runoffs also be rigged by
their own logic?

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:20.870
This all came to a glorious crescendo yesterday
on Fox and Friends when Lefler was interviewed

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:27.040
and she was asked, why wouldn't the January
runoff be just as rigged as the November election?

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.760
And she just she literally cannot explain
it.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.280
Take a look at this.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.060
We've heard from the president who said that
the election was stolen from him, that it

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:36.810
