vote is thrown out.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.400
So what's different now than it was in November
where it's no longer rigged?

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:08.500
Yeah, so we're in the courts right now asking
for better signature verification processes,

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:14.069
a bipartisan verification to have consistent
verification county to county, as well as

00:02:14.069 --> 00:02:16.419
the addition of four thousand poll watchers.

00:02:16.419 --> 00:02:19.579
We also have a statewide organization getting
out the vote.

00:02:19.579 --> 00:02:24.010
One thousand workers going across the state
backed by 40 thousand volunteers.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.769
If we vote, we will win.

00:02:25.769 --> 00:02:28.299
If we don't vote, we will lose the country.

00:02:28.299 --> 00:02:30.129
We are the firewall to socialism.

00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:34.859
And you saw in my debate last week, I'm running
against the most radically liberal candidate

00:02:34.859 --> 00:02:37.269
that has ever run for the Senate.

00:02:37.269 --> 00:02:39.349
He's someone that would defund the police.

00:02:39.349 --> 00:02:41.739
He refused to renounce socialism.

00:02:41.739 --> 00:02:45.739
We have to push back against this radical
agenda of the left and it's up to Georgia

00:02:45.739 --> 00:02:47.269
