00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.849
And then she says we're really working hard
to get out the vote, get out.

00:03:08.849 --> 00:03:09.849
The vote is campaigning.

00:03:09.849 --> 00:03:11.919
It has nothing to do with rigging.

00:03:11.919 --> 00:03:16.559
And then she just goes into socialism and
attacks her opponent, Raphael Warnock.

00:03:16.559 --> 00:03:20.950
She can't answer the question, so she just
has her buzzwords from the debate.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.809
But this was a totally different question.

00:03:22.809 --> 00:03:29.019
If you believe it was rigged in November and
your vote wasn't counted accurately or at

00:03:29.019 --> 00:03:31.510
all, why would you vote this time?

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.089
Because nothing has changed.

00:03:33.089 --> 00:03:34.180
And it's a great question.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.559
And she says, well, because my opponents are
radical.

00:03:36.559 --> 00:03:38.919
OK, that's not really an answer.

00:03:38.919 --> 00:03:40.760
And it's actually a disaster.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:46.139
And really depressing that these races in
Georgia are even close, but they are close

