00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.699
So we have to vote either way.

00:04:11.699 --> 00:04:12.919
We have to vote.

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:15.949
And it would be a major accomplishment.

00:04:15.949 --> 00:04:17.180
Major accomplishment.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:22.580
To be able to, after everything that's gone
down, take control of the Senate 50 50 with

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:28.670
Comilla as the deciding vote January 5th is
